        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_36deebaf216849e288987999a4ce949b",
      "statement": "PR authorship is independently constrained from general run credentials: a user-owned public thread requires an authenticated requester and only honors a requested author who participated in the thread; private threads stay pinned to their owner, system threads use the App, and background completion cannot publish with a saved user identity.",
