      "statement": "The dashboard uses GitHub OAuth and a seven-day HS256 osw_session JWT signed with DASHBOARD_JWT_SECRET; login binds signed state to an HttpOnly nonce cookie using a constant-time comparison, restricts redirects, authorizes the GitHub login, stores OAuth credentials, and then issues the session.",
